<para>Resets the Sha256 structure. Note: this is only supported if you have WOLFSSL_TI_HASH defined.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>none いいえ返します。 <emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Sha256<sp/>sha256;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">byte<sp/>data[]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>Data<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>hashed<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">word32<sp/>len<sp/>=<sp/>sizeof(data);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">if<sp/>((ret<sp/>=<sp/>wc_InitSha256(&amp;sha256))<sp/>!=<sp/>0)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>WOLFSSL_MSG(&quot;wc_InitSha256<sp/>failed&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
